BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//icalendar//mxm.dk//
LAST-MODIFIED:20250827T145813Z
NAME:🎬 SIFF (Uptown House 3)
X-WR-CALNAME:🎬 SIFF (Uptown House 3)
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:It’s Never Over\, Jeff Buckley
DTSTART:20250827T224500Z
DTEND:20250828T005500Z
DTSTAMP:20250827T224500Z
UID:nAGc0HS7dt
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 106 mins (1h46m)\n\nThe definitive tale of Jeff Buck
 ley\, the rising young star with an otherworldly voice whose sudden death 
 at age 30\, after the release of his critically acclaimed debut album "Gra
 ce\," shocked the world. Told through never-before-seen footage from Buckl
 ey’s archives and intimate accounts. Exclusive 11"x17" poster for first 
 50 people in the door for the 7:30pm screening on Friday\, August 8! These
  exclusive pieces were designed by legendary rock 'n' roll illustrator Jes
 s Rotter\, are available exclusively in theaters\, and will not be printed
  again. Includes 26 minutes of exclusive\, remastered footage from a previ
 ously unreleased solo performance* filmed February 19\, 1994\, screening i
 mmediately after the film.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/its-
 never-over-jeff-buckley
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cloud
DTSTART:20250828T014500Z
DTEND:20250828T041000Z
DTSTAMP:20250828T014500Z
UID:KjxSpY7mbQ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 124 mins (2h04m)\n\nLegendary filmmaker Kiyoshi Kuro
 sawa (Pulse\, Cure\, Tokyo Sonata) ramps up the thrills in this genre-bend
 ing potboiler about a craven opportunist who finds success as an internet 
 reseller\, only for revenge-seeking vigilantes to come calling.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/cloud
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
